      "writtenOn": "2024-05-17T10:43:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, the panic data doesn\u0027t provide the exception number. Zephyr logs the type and subtype on the console:\n```\nDEBUG:[0.078000] \u003cerr\u003e os: ***** USAGE FAULT *****\nDEBUG:[0.084000] \u003cerr\u003e os:   Attempt to execute undefined instruction\nDEBUG:[0.091000] \u003cerr\u003e os: \u003e\u003e\u003e ZEPHYR FATAL ERROR 0: CPU exception on CPU 0\nDEBUG:[0.098000] \u003cerr\u003e os: Current thread: 0x20002470 (test_ftrapv)\n```\nThe [reason](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/include/zephyr/arch/arm/arch.h#L62) is provided to the fatal error [handler](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/panic.c;l\u003d144), but we do not save that to the panic data. The current panic data structure is not adjusted to store that info.",
      "parentUuid": "d71e6c17_f4ef112f",
      "revId": "614229c93845d214709275fb0e79017834f12a58",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52ae8d45_199921c1",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/hwtest/src/ftrapv.c",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 24,
